28 Weeks Later is a 2007  post-apocalyptic horror film directed by Juan Carlos
Fresnadillo, who co-wrote it with Rowan Joffé, Enrique López Lavigne and Jesus Olmo.

13
01:01:17,142 --> 01:01:23,142
It is the sequel to 28 Days Later (2002) and the
second film in the 28 Days Later series.

14
01:05:59,999 --> 01:06:05,999
The film stars Robert Carlyle, Rose Byrne, Jeremy
Renner, Harold Perrineau, and Idris Elba.

15
01:10:42,857 --> 01:10:48,857
It is set just over six months after the events of the first film, depicting the efforts of United States-led NATO forces to establish a safe zone in London, the
consequence of two young siblings breaking protocol to find a photograph of their mother, and the resulting reintroduction of the rage virus into the safezone.

16
01:15:25,714 --> 01:15:31,714
28 Weeks Later was theatrically released on 11 May 2007 in the United Kingdom and
United States by 20th Century Fox and Fox Atomic, respectively.

17
01:20:08,571 --> 01:20:14,571
It received positive reviews and grossed over $72.3 million worldwide.

18
01:24:51,428 --> 01:24:57,428
A sequel, 28 Years Later, was released on 20 June 2025.

19
01:29:34,285 --> 01:29:40,285
The film explores themes of dying and death, london, england,
sibling relationship, chaos, loss of loved one.

20
01:34:17,142 --> 01:34:23,142
The tone is dark and thought_provoking and intense.
